  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "第二天傍晚，她在收货间待满了一天。",
      "characters": 15,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 90,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "没有发现咬伤，精神也一直清醒。",
      "characters": 13,
      "start_frame": 90,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 168,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "我们再次核对完昨晚的经过，我打开了内门。",
      "characters": 18,
      "start_frame": 168,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 276,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "她进来后，先把空水瓶放进了回收袋。",
      "characters": 15,
      "start_frame": 276,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 366,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "我挑了两块快到期的牛排，又洗了一大碗草莓。",
      "characters": 19,
      "start_frame": 366,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 480,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "她看着锅，问我会不会煎。",
      "characters": 10,
      "start_frame": 480,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 540,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "我说，包装上写着。",
      "characters": 7,
      "start_frame": 540,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 582,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "她接过夹子，把快糊的那块翻了个面。",
      "characters": 15,
      "start_frame": 582,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 672,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "这是出事后，我第一次和人坐着吃饭。",
      "characters": 15,
      "start_frame": 672,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 762,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "她问我，明天想做什么。",
      "characters": 9,
      "start_frame": 762,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 816,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "我说，把旁边的休息室收拾出来，再把剩下的货架清一遍。",
      "characters": 23,
      "start_frame": 816,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 954,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "她点点头，说设备归她。",
      "characters": 9,
      "start_frame": 954,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1008,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "吃完，我把监控室的备用钥匙放在她碗边。",
      "characters": 17,
      "start_frame": 1008,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1110,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "她没急着拿，先看了我一眼。",
      "characters": 11,
      "start_frame": 1110,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1176,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "我说，今晚我值前半夜，后半夜换你。",
      "characters": 14,
      "start_frame": 1176,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1260,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "她这才收起钥匙，把最后一块牛角包分给了我。",
      "characters": 19,
      "start_frame": 1260,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1374,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    }
  ],
